      "side": 1,
      "message": "The goal is to read bpf from NetworkStack process.\nThis is to help NetworkStack understand if networking of an uid is blocked by bpf.\n\nAfter discussion, an API in Tethering module is needed for this.\nHowever, this API cannot make IPC, given that the method will be called frequently (100+ times per 20sec).\nSo it turns out we want to read bpf, and return directly inside user process, while the user is NetworkStack only.\n\n\nMore context can be found here:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1fMobAvwYi_bEGCguSvxTpXbmvFWAj2hl8uZaIH3MDNg/edit#heading\u003dh.uho8jxjd9d8a",
      "parentUuid": "23553566_9de63b27",
